<form class="pv-planner" action="/plan" method="get"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Start with your journey</p><h2>A little preparation.<br>A better trip together.</h2><div class="pv-fields"><label>Leaving from<select name="origin" required><option value="">Choose origin</option><% countries.forEach(c=>{ %><option><%= c.destinationCountry %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Travelling to<select name="destination" required><option value="">Choose destination</option><% countries.forEach(c=>{ %><option><%= c.destinationCountry %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Your companion<select name="pet" required><option value="dog">Dog</option><option value="cat">Cat</option><option value="bird">Bird</option><option value="other">Other pet</option></select></label><label>Departure (optional)<input name="departure" type="date"></label></div><button class="pv-button" type="submit">Build my research plan →</button><p class="pv-fine-print">A starting point for research, not travel clearance. Confirm current requirements with official authorities and your airline.</p></form>
